# Agent Skills live at the cross-agent discovery path .agents/skills/ (read by
# Zed, Codex CLI, opencode, Kimi Code, and MiniMax). Git cannot re-include a
# file beneath an excluded directory, so each level is unwound explicitly.
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/npm-release-and-cleanup/

